id: E8212-draft-2501_91199785
trigger_tool: autoreconf|aclocal|automake|perl
phase: bootstrap
error_signature: "Can't load.*auto/Cwd/Cwd.so.*Permission denied|Error loading shared library.*Cwd.so.*Permission denied"
severity: 2
category: autotools|perl|ohos|security
match_keywords: autoreconf, Cwd.so, Permission denied, PERL5LIB, Conan cache, Perl XS, system perl
title: Use one host Perl and pure-Perl Autotools modules when CI cannot load Conan-cache XS
root_cause: >
  The CI autoreconf process is launched by the host Perl, while Conan's build
  environment exposes the Conan Perl core and XS directories through PERL5LIB.
  Loading Cwd.so from the user-cache path can be denied by the OHOS worker.
  Setting PERL alone does not change the interpreter already selected by an
  autoreconf shebang or remove the XS paths from PERL5LIB.
affected_scope: OHOS Autotools bootstrap using Conan Autoconf and Automake packages when the host Perl works but Conan-cache XS modules cannot be dlopen'ed
verification_cmd: "host perl -MCwd succeeds; with PERL5LIB limited to Automake/Autoconf share directories, run the packaged autoreconf and both real Automake scripts, then verify conan create and all upstream/consumer tests"
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: single-host-perl-with-pure-autotools-module-paths
rec_description: >
  Select a host Perl outside the Conan Perl package before applying conanbuild.
  Execute the packaged autoreconf wrapper by absolute path, bind PERL to that
  same host interpreter, and scope PERL5LIB to the pure-Perl Automake and
  Autoconf share directories for bootstrap only. Launch the Automake real
  scripts through that interpreter with their relocatable data-directory
  arguments. Retain the Conan tool requirements for their actual payloads.
rec_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: "chmod 777 on Conan-cache Cwd.so or modify shared Perl package"
forbid_1_reason: Unix mode changes do not establish that the OHOS worker permits dlopen, and mutating the shared package corrupts other consumers
forbid_2_pattern: "set PERL to host interpreter while retaining Conan Perl core or XS paths in PERL5LIB"
forbid_2_reason: The host interpreter can still load a foreign or denied Cwd.so before Autotools starts
similar_to: E212, E131, E729-draft-GSSN, DRAFT-6049-libnxml-0.18.5-autotools-perl-dual-arch
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/E8212-draft-2501_91199785.md
source_event: "libgenome CI build #63612 and target W3 libgenome-w3-20260928T081735Z"
last_updated: 2026-09-28
draft: true
